  m_text: "\nHello! I'm HyperRSmash.\nThis game was developed as a personal side
    project with a very small budget and marks the first game I've ever created.
    It took a lot of learning and effort to bring it all together, but I'm excited
    to finally share it.\n\nThe game is horror-themed\u2014one of my favorite genres
    to play\u2014so I thought, why not try making a small experience that others
    can enjoy too?\n\nIt's designed to last around 20 minutes. I hope you find it
    intriguing, atmospheric, and worth your time. Thank you so much for playing!!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a0e9eb4d7d85eed45aa431d905f60c2d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
